<h1 class="page-title">Feedra Prototype</h1>
<p class="standfirst">UI/UX design, prototyping &amp; sound design &middot; 2025 &middot; for Pierre Proske</p>

<p>Feedra is a soundboard app for running live sound, whether it's a game master's tabletop campaign or a stage show. In 2025 Pierre Proske was developing it, and wanted to see students' alternative approaches. This is mine: I designed the interface and the user experience, built the interactive prototype, and did the sound design for its demo scenes.</p>
<p>In the prototype, sounds are organised into campaigns and scenes, and each scene is a board of pads: big ones that loop (ambiences and music) and small ones for one-off effects, each with its own picture, volume, fades and effects. You build a scene's whole soundscape beforehand, then play it live.</p>

